			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120170401,
					"content": "現在在做的事就是「留影」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170402,
					"content": "嗯，不錯，又學到新東西了。快開始吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1201705,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1201705
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1201705",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1201705,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"影"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120170501,
					"content": "拍好啦，妳看，這就是剛剛為妳拍出來的畫片。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170502,
					"content": "這…好神奇。是某種法術嗎？這裡面的…是又複製出了一個我？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170503,
					"content": "可她又似乎不會動，不會說話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170504,
						120170505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170504,
					"content": "這只是一種紀錄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170506,
					"content": "剛剛還覺得拍得不好看，身體有點僵硬，可是現在看起來，比我想像中自然多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170507,
					"content": "動作一模一樣，後面的風景也一模一樣…這是怎麼做到的呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170508,
					"content": "這就是它厲害的地方啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170509,
					"content": "等等，我還是不太能理解其中原理，多解釋一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170510,
					"content": "就是說，這個裡面的，不是我？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170511,
					"content": "如果不是我，那麼為什麼可以和我一模一樣。如果是我，那麼現在的我是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170512,
					"content": "#這…超出我的解答能力了，交給{F#妳}{M#你}，{NICKNAME}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170513,
					"content": "可能就像將軍與妳的區別吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170514
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170514,
					"content": "對喔，妳覺得將軍算不算是妳呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170515,
					"content": "那當然算，我從來都沒有把稻妻交給別人管理的意願。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170516,
					"content": "那現在的妳是什麼呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170517,
					"content": "這麼說的話，我也是我，這是毋庸置疑的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170518,
					"content": "「妳」的存在不一定是單一的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170519
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170519,
					"content": "「我」的存在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170520,
					"content": "我好像明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170521,
					"content": "我就是我，僅有一個，但可能有無數種存在的形式。我以什麼形式存在，其實並不重要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170522,
					"content": "比如將軍，就是我的某一種存在形式，她究竟是不是我，這個問題絕不會被她身上的某個零件決定。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170523,
					"content": "這麼說的話，這個畫片也是妳的一種存在形式啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170524,
					"content": "嗯，就連追求「永恆」的我，存在形式都在不斷變化…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170525,
					"content": "那我怎麼能要求稻妻，還有生活在稻妻的每個人，都保持不變呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170526,
						120170527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170526,
					"content": "稻妻的本質沒那麼容易改變。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170528
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170528,
					"content": "#和{F#妳}{M#你}們這一路走下來，見識到的全是我認知之外的內容。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170529,
					"content": "#唉，讓{F#妳}{M#你}們見識到我笨拙的一面了。{F#妳}{M#你}們可能感受不到，這些東西的確衝擊了我的認知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170530,
					"content": "如果用這些東西來定義，那如今的稻妻已經與我的印象大相徑庭了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170531,
					"content": "但是，絕不能因此就說，現在的稻妻已經不是稻妻了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170532,
					"content": "沒錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170533
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170533,
					"content": "眼狩令，千手百眼神像，這些都是為了催生「永恆」，但如果我離「永恆」真的愈來愈近的話，一切的故事都不會發生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170534,
					"content": "哈啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170535,
					"content": "我是否…將一切都抓得太緊了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170536,
					"content": "看來影是想通了呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170537,
					"content": "那我覺得，我們這一段導遊做得非常有價值！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170538,
					"content": "二少爺，二少爺！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170539,
					"content": "咦，為什麼下面那麼吵？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170540
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170540,
					"content": "好像是一平，他怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170541
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170541,
					"content": "那是天領奉行的人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170542
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170542,
					"content": "對，我們去問問看發生了什麼吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170527,
					"content": "人類的本質沒那麼容易改變。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170528
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170505,
					"content": "這並不是真正的妳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170506
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1201707,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1201707
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1201707",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1201707,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"一平"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120170701,
					"content": "一平，發生什麼事了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170702,
					"content": "#啊，是{F#妳}{M#你}們，我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170703,
					"content": "欸？將、將軍大人？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170704,
					"content": "您是要見九條鐮治少爺嗎？抱歉，他現在還沒有回來。如果方便的話，可以由小人代為傳達嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170705,
					"content": "不必多禮，並不是專程來訪，只是聽到了你呼喊的聲音。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170706,
					"content": "你在找你家的二少爺嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170707,
					"content": "#是的，不瞞{F#妳}{M#你}說，二少爺他去談判遲遲沒有回來，我很擔心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170708,
					"content": "他平時有在外面閒逛不回來的習慣，可能只是在什麼地方入迷了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170709,
					"content": "但不知道為什麼，今天我特別不安。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170710,
					"content": "九條鐮治，聽起來像是九條家的後人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170711,
					"content": "是的，實在抱歉。由於家主身體抱恙，大少爺常年在外，現在九條家是由九條鐮治少爺擔任九條家的名代。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170712,
					"content": "天領奉行陷入混亂，這我也略有耳聞。這件事和九條鐮治有關嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170713,
					"content": "抱歉，將軍大人，這也是九條家的失職。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170714,
					"content": "由於九條家名譽大損、勢力衰微，將軍您…呃，天領奉行後續的安排，將軍您尚未給出決策…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170715,
					"content": "所以二少爺才前去商量，是否能請到「鷹司家」主持大局…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170716,
					"content": "那應該是在奉行所談吧，為什麼要到這裡來找呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170717,
					"content": "啊，不是的，這次會面的地點比較特殊。其實我也有點疑惑，但大人物的事，我也不敢多問。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170718,
					"content": "地點在鳴神大社附近的山上，那裡好像有「鷹司家」的特殊營地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170719,
					"content": "「鷹司」…也是熟悉的名字，這麼多年，他們應該都在忠心輔佐九條吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170720,
					"content": "是的是的，就是因為這樣，二少爺才會去談判。但無論有多少事需要談，這花費的時間也太多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170721,
					"content": "城裡我都尋遍了，如果他還沒回來的話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170722,
						120170723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170722,
					"content": "還沒有結束吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170724
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170724,
					"content": "是啊，我也想到了這種可能…但以我的身分，可不能冒冒失失地獨闖「鷹司家」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170725,
					"content": "我們去幫你看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170726
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170726,
					"content": "不用不用，應該只是我多心了。要是打擾了談判，我反而沒辦法交代。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170727,
					"content": "雖然我只是二少爺的小跟班，但我從小就跟他一起長大，我只是…很怕他出事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170728,
					"content": "我不如二少爺聰明伶俐，也沒辦法幫二少爺分擔太多壓力，但我不想因為我的失職而讓二少爺遭遇危險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170729,
					"content": "唔，將軍大人怎麼看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170730,
					"content": "我們親自走一趟吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170731,
					"content": "以我的身分，就算妨礙了談判，應該也不會影響到你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170732,
					"content": "而且，本就是我未能及時決策的緣故，應該由我來出面解決。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170733,
						120170734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "影"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170733,
					"content": "很有擔當。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170735
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170735,
					"content": "感激不盡，感謝將軍大人能出手相助！我也會再去其他地方找找看！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170736,
					"content": "#那我現在就把那個營地的位置為{F#妳}{M#你}們標記出來，希望一路順利！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "一平"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170734,
					"content": "很帥氣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170735
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170723,
					"content": "可能遇到突發情況了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170724
					]
				}
			]
		},
